<p>Finally, it is imperative to highlight the necessity of <strong>100% declared-value marine transit insurance</strong>. Standard transit coverage often applies a depreciation clause, meaning you would only receive a fraction of the vehicle’s current market value in the event of an accident, theft, or damage during transit.</p>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">By opting for 100% declared-value marine transit insurance, you ensure that the insurance payout matches the exact value you have declared for the vehicle, providing complete financial protection against any unforeseen incidents between Bangalore and Hubli.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>This specific coverage type is non-negotiable for high-value assets and offers peace of mind by eliminating the financial risk of depreciation during the journey.</span></li></ul></div>
